cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "rnaseq-tki-resistance: bulk RNA-seq pipeline for drug resistance studies"
abstract: >-
  Bulk RNA-seq analysis pipeline for drug resistance studies in designs
  without biological replicates: QC, TMM normalization, fold-change
  classification, resistance signatures and GO/KEGG enrichment.
authors:
  - family-names: "Navajas-Chocarro"
    given-names: "Pablo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/navachoc/rnaseq-tki-resistance"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - drug resistance
  - tyrosine kinase inhibitors
  - TMM normalization
  - fold change
  - enrichment analysis
